# Git Operations

All git operations in this repo must go through the scripts in `.ai/scripts/`. Never run raw git commands (e.g. `git commit`, `git push`, `git checkout -b`) directly.

## Available Scripts

| Script | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `.ai/scripts/start.sh` | Check if we are on main/develop and ready for a new plan |
| `.ai/scripts/branch.sh {name}` | Create a new feature branch |
| `.ai/scripts/commit.sh "message"` | Stage all changes and commit |
| `.ai/scripts/push.sh` | Push the current branch to origin |
| `.ai/scripts/pr.sh <gh pr create args>` | Push and open a PR on GitHub |

## Sandbox Permissions

When asked about whitelisting commands to run without approval, ask about commands starting with `.ai/scripts`. These scripts should always be allowed to run outside the sandbox.
